# README media: DOT & DASH. The GIF is played with plain button presses from
# a new game: Dot shrinks into the rug at full size, then (with the Shrink
# Tonic handed over by cheat) into a speck of the rug, and walks into
# Tuftville. The stills jump to places with the test cheats.
shotscale 2
wipe_saves
seed 45
game dotdash
wait 185
shot dotdash_title
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 20
press A
wait 10
cheat up tonic1
cheat skip_dialog
wait 5
gifstart dotdash 3 1
wait 10
hold DOWN 95
waituntil trans == 0 60
wait 20
hold LEFT 20
wait 10
hold DOWN 95
waituntil trans == 0 60
wait 30
print town
hold RIGHT 40
wait 20
gifstop
shot dotdash_town
cheat up mitt1
cheat up bean1
cheat glints 137
cheat skip_dialog
cheat area 0 50 64
wait 150
shot dotdash_small
cheat area 2 30 30
wait 150
shot dotdash_walls
cheat area 5 30 18
wait 150
shot dotdash_boss
cheat area 0 70 82
cheat full
wait 200
shot dotdash_room
